{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside a twisting, suffocating maze with only two objectives: find the ancient book hidden somewhere in the darkness\u2026 and get out alive.<br>The halls echo with distant footsteps, and whatever lurks in the shadows never seems to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Abyssal Maze</strong> is a three-stage horror experience designed to push your nerves and patience to their limit. You have no weapons, no special abilities, just your instincts, your hearing, and the hope that you\u2019re not too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Escalating Stages</strong><br>Each maze is bigger, darker, and more distorted than the last. By the time you reach the third stage, every step feels like a gamble. Only the most determined players make it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth, Not Strength</strong><br>The creatures hunting you can\u2019t be fought. All you can do is listen carefully\u2026 and run when you must.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Driven Survival</strong> <br>Growls, footsteps, and distant echoes guide your decisions. Paying attention to audio cues is the key to staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Books and Secrets</strong><br>Every stage contains a mysterious book. Find it and the exit to push deeper into the maze\u2019s nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy, Unsettling Atmosphere</strong><br>Oppressive sound design and unpredictable enemy movement keep you tense from the first step to the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to escape the Abyssal Maze\u2026<br>or will the walls claim you like all the others who never found the way out?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4129870?t=1768413573","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129870/9c14eb4a75fe5811734782a361038c93d3a20726/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768413573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129870/699a3cd40d57aeea37aaeda0b458ae832fdae805/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768413573","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129870/699a3cd40d57aeea37aaeda0b458ae832fdae805/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768413573","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4245940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside a twisting, suffocating maze with only two objectives: find the ancient book hidden somewhere in the darkness\u2026 and get out alive.<br>The halls echo with distant footsteps, and whatever lurks in the shadows never seems to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Abyssal Maze</strong> is a three-stage horror experience designed to push your nerves and patience to their limit. You have no weapons, no special abilities, just your instincts, your hearing, and the hope that you\u2019re not too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Escalating Stages</strong><br>Each maze is bigger, darker, and more distorted than the last. By the time you reach the third stage, every step feels like a gamble. Only the most determined players make it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth, Not Strength</strong><br>The creatures hunting you can\u2019t be fought. All you can do is listen carefully\u2026 and run when you must.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Driven Survival</strong> <br>Growls, footsteps, and distant echoes guide your decisions. Paying attention to audio cues is the key to staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Books and Secrets</strong><br>Every stage contains a mysterious book. Find it and the exit to push deeper into the maze\u2019s nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy, Unsettling Atmosphere</strong><br>Oppressive sound design and unpredictable enemy movement keep you tense from the first step to the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to escape the Abyssal Maze\u2026<br>or will the walls claim you like all the others who never found the way out?</p>","developers":["AbyssalEdgeStudios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129870/ca3c8ea4d303f01a93c737661ec3748d9b78d866/header.jpg?t=1768413573","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel core i3 | AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> N/A</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended